sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant APP as iOS app
    participant SE as Secure Enclave
    participant AA as App Attest
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant WEB as ASWebAuthenticationSession
    participant KC as Keychain
    participant GW as REST API Gateway
    U->>APP: taps Log In or Sign Up
    APP->>SE: create P-256 key, non-exportable
    SE-->>APP: public key, thumbprint jkt
    APP->>AA: generate assertion over PAR request hash
    AA-->>APP: attestation assertion
    APP->>AS: POST /par client_id, PKCE S256, state, resource api, dpop_jkt, attestation
    Note over AS: first-party client pre-registered, attestation checked, parameters fixed server-side
    AS-->>APP: request_uri, expires_in 60
    APP->>WEB: start with /authorize?client_id and request_uri, ephemeral session
    WEB->>AS: GET /authorize
    AS-->>WEB: login page in system browser sheet
    U->>WEB: passkey with Face ID, or password plus TOTP
    WEB->>AS: POST /login
    AS-->>WEB: 302 to https universal link callback with code, state, iss
    WEB-->>APP: callback URL
    Note over APP: state and iss checked exactly
    APP->>SE: sign DPoP proof for POST /token
    APP->>AS: POST /token code, code_verifier, DPoP proof
    Note over AS: code single use, PKCE, proof jkt equals dpop_jkt
    AS-->>APP: token N aud api 10 min, refresh token, both bound to jkt
    APP->>KC: store refresh token, this device only, not synced
    Note over APP: token N lives in memory only
    APP->>SE: sign DPoP proof for GET /v1/devices
    APP->>GW: GET /v1/devices Authorization DPoP token N, DPoP proof
    GW-->>APP: 200 devices
